model g6_where_refused_twin
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-04-30
  note "T, tally 2.1.6 (#51, P2), G6: the twin of g6/where_refused: eve's share is 4, so her where holds and every read answers."

source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

kind member

place purse: accounts DUK lives 2026-01-01..

place box: accounts DUK lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input share[p in member]: int

input due_day: date

input early_day: date

input fee: money DUK

move dues[p in member on due_day where 1 / share[p] > 0]: transfers
  on due_day
  leg cash from purse to world amount fee

move early[p in member on early_day where share[p] >= 0]: transfers
  on early_day
  leg cash from purse to world amount fee

move gift: transfers
  on due_day
  leg cash from world to box amount fee

ask q_purse: bal(purse, 2026-02-28), bal(purse, 2026-03-31) law cut

ask q_box: bal(box, 2026-02-28), bal(box, 2026-03-31) law cut

ask q_flows: flows(dues, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-31), flows(dues, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-02-28), flows(early, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-02-28), flows(gift, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-31) law cut

ask q_n: count(p in member on due_day) law cut

version facts
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  member + [ada, eve, ivo] lives 2026-01-01..
  share[ada] = 1 "ada's share"
  share[eve] = 4 "eve's share"
  share[ivo] = -1 "ivo's share, his where fails"
  due_day = 2026-03-12 "the dues' day"
  early_day = 2026-02-05 "the early dues' day"
  fee = 5.00 "the fee"
  opening[purse] = 100 at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[box] = 50 at 2026-01-01 start
